Relations
Relation	Module	Parent	Description
_inputs	data bank		each input stored, the number of its values stored, and its file
_sheets	data bank	_inputs	each sheet an input's schema gives, by its place
_fields	data bank	_sheets	each field of a sheet's header, by its position
_communicated	data bank	_inputs	each session and agent an input's values were communicated to, and how many
_stored	data bank	_inputs	each value stored whole: when it was stored, and on which event
_instances	converter		every instance within each input value, molten: the instance that holds it, the JSON Pointer from it, its type and its text
_runs	converter	_instances	each run of text of a string that holds FF, a line break or HT
annotations	converter	_instances	each subschema applied to an instance, by its location in the schema, and whether the instance is valid against it
references	converter		each $ref of the schema, by the location of the subschema that holds it, and the location of the schema it references
relations	converter		each relation the schema gives, by the location of the subschema that gives it, the relation it is subordinate to, and its kind
name parts	converter	relations	each part of a relation's path within its parent's instance, in order
columns	converter	relations	each column of a relation that holds a simple domain, by the location of the subschema that gives it
column parts	converter	columns	each part of a column's label, in order
records	converter	relations	each instance a relation holds as a record, and the instance whose record holds it
cells	converter	records	each field of a record that holds a simple domain, and the instance whose text it holds
keys	converter	records	each record's _parent and _pointer
places	converter	relations	each relation's place in the order of the schema's tree, and the place of each of its columns
field texts	field	cells	each cell's text, as its field holds it
